{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_49E2AD4D","title":"Mertie has a Clue","entry":"Dlg_49E2AD4D::entry","exit":"Dlg_49E2AD4D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B1754D81","articyId":"72057714297045557","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"What’s new, my little amigo? You need light? Auntie’s got a deal for you, finest neon in all Nivalis!","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What’s new, my little amigo? You need light? Auntie’s got a deal for you, finest neon in all Nivalis!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-1022.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47088","byteOffset":32147072,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_03BC2C06","articyId":"72057714297045577","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"All kinds! Take it from me, you need a lantern or four. That’ll bring in the business like bugs to a bulb.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All kinds! Take it from me, you need a lantern or four. That’ll bring in the business like bugs to a bulb.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-423.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22266","byteOffset":16309528,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_1545B403","articyId":"72057714297045646","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Oh ho, see - that's a bit of goss you're after! Get me a few new punters and I'll tell. Cross my heart and swear to die.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh ho, see - that's a bit of goss you're after! Get me a few new punters and I'll tell. Cross my heart and swear to die.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37556","byteOffset":28545728,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_08C43276","articyId":"72057714297045672","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"He asked a lot of his friends, did Thadd. Sometimes too much.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He asked a lot of his friends, did Thadd. Sometimes too much.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2487.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38254","byteOffset":28807728,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_8E862B56","articyId":"72057791606430667","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"I know everything that goes on around here. You think people come to market to buy eggs and spuds? Ha! They come for info, little amigo.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know everything that goes on around here. You think people come to market to buy eggs and spuds? Ha! They come for info, little amigo.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":151.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41995","byteOffset":30214472,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_97EC5AFC","articyId":"72057791606430681","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Oh now slow your hooter. Old Mertie don't give up the goods that easy. You ain't even called me \"auntie\" yet.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh now slow your hooter. Old Mertie don't give up the goods that easy. You ain't even called me \"auntie\" yet.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32119","byteOffset":20031368,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_0A4FA1A3","articyId":"72057791606430702","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Tell you what, amiguito, you get me a few new customers, I'll tell you what I hear on the old vine. Savvy?","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tell you what, amiguito, you get me a few new customers, I'll tell you what I hear on the old vine. Savvy?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1299.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43252","byteOffset":30691776,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_DCE0F9E5","articyId":"72057791606430709","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Kinda sour ain't you, amiguito? Thaddeus didn't mention that.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Kinda sour ain't you, amiguito? Thaddeus didn't mention that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1299.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17700","byteOffset":14585704,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_BDCD63E3","articyId":"72057791606430723","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Me and him go back a long ways. Always been mates, even if we didn't always see peeper to peeper.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me and him go back a long ways. Always been mates, even if we didn't always see peeper to peeper.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1873.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22679","byteOffset":16465344,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_9EF4FE04","articyId":"72057791606430738","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Thaddeus said you were the lively type.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thaddeus said you were the lively type.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1873.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24483","byteOffset":17140008,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_C7AB0F70","articyId":"72057791606430766","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"Stay outta the shadows, little amigo.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Stay outta the shadows, little amigo.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30035","byteOffset":19242664,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_715C8713","articyId":"72057791606430774","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mertie Batt","text":"How do you think? Use that chrome tongue of yours to sell my stuff. Everyone needs a bit of neon.","speakerId":"Ntt_AB642C57","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do you think? Use that chrome tongue of yours to sell my stuff. Everyone needs a bit of neon.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3725.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28205","byteOffset":18552392,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_A0BE3C4E","articyId":"720577